{"resourceIdentifier":"2592","resourceName":"Hongya MSW landfill site biogas power generation project","description":"Hongya MSW landfill site biogas power generation project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Hongya MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as the Hongya landfill site), in Hongya County,Meishan City, Sichuan Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Hongya BCCY New Energy CO., Ltd. (hereafter referred to as the project owner).\r\nThe project started to construct on 23/11/2020.The project has a total designed capacity 2MW (4*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 85,880 MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 52,132tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 521,321tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":29.938054,"longitude":103.452222},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-10-07","endExclusive":"2021-11-07","endInclusive":"2021-11-06"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2592"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Meishan City of Sichuan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2592"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"52132"}]},{"code":"PR